{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "38348478",
      "title": "Outsourcing Concept Items Into a Reusable Component",
      "sourceHash": "2d4a7090b06deed6811b7a7e3a814a5806bc0af814fcec259a2e4f569c988f59",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.483,
          "end": 3.3,
          "en": "So let's now outsource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.3,
          "end": 7.203,
          "en": "these concept items here, into a separate component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.751,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "And for that of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 13.74,
          "en": "I wanna outsource this list item code here in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.74,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "into a separate component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 17.07,
          "en": "For that, in the components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.07,
          "end": 20.64,
          "en": "we can add another sub folder called concept,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.64,
          "end": 23.509,
          "en": "though of course this name as always, is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.509,
          "end": 28.08,
          "en": "And then in there, create a concept.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.08,
          "end": 30.57,
          "en": "where I also have my concept function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.57,
          "end": 32.58,
          "en": "for this concept component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.58,
          "end": 34.77,
          "en": "which of course must be exported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.77,
          "end": 36.993,
          "en": "to make it available outside of this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.43,
          "end": 43.43,
          "en": "And then here, I want to return this list item, JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "So I can cut it from here, from app.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 49.533,
          "en": "and move it here into concept.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.97,
          "end": 54.04,
          "en": "Now, one very important note here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.04,
          "end": 57.008,
          "en": "in theory, we could now create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.008,
          "end": 60.12,
          "en": "three different concept components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.12,
          "end": 63.299,
          "en": "one for every core concept that we're outputting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.299,
          "end": 65.4,
          "en": "But if we would do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 69.12,
          "en": "we would still be duplicating, and replicating code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.12,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "And if we ever wanted to delete the paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 74.1,
          "en": "we still would have to do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.1,
          "end": 76.143,
          "en": "in three different components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.13,
          "end": 80.58,
          "en": "That's why I'm not building three different components here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "But instead, one reusable component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 86.46000000000001,
          "en": "which must be configurable, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.46000000000001,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "It must be configurable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 90.53999999999999,
          "en": "so that one and the same component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.53999999999999,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "can output different data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "Data that's always output in the same way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 99.03,
          "en": "so that it always has the same shape in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 101.499,
          "en": "But the different data pieces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.499,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "the image, the title, the description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 108.93,
          "en": "the values stored under those keys, that will differ.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.93,
          "end": 111.87,
          "en": "And that's the idea here with this function component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.87,
          "end": 112.703,
          "en": "So therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.703,
          "end": 115.787,
          "en": "it must be configurable, in order to be reusable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.787,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "And how do we make it configurable?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 121.113,
          "en": "With help of props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 126.18,
          "en": "So here we can, and should, accept this props argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.18,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "this props parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "which will be created and managed automatically by React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 132.96,
          "en": "and which will be passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.96,
          "end": 135.363,
          "en": "into this component function by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.8,
          "end": 139.82999999999998,
          "en": "And then with that, here we can, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.82999999999998,
          "end": 144.82999999999998,
          "en": "output props.image, and here props.title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "And here it's also props.title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 150.72,
          "en": "And the same as true here for description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.72,
          "end": 152.733,
          "en": "it's props.description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.93,
          "end": 157.26,
          "en": "And with that, we made this component configurable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.26,
          "end": 160.65,
          "en": "and it does now accept an image, a title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.65,
          "end": 162.36,
          "en": "and a description key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.36,
          "end": 164.07,
          "en": "which can and should be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.07,
          "end": 167.043,
          "en": "when that component is being used in JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 170.516,
          "en": "Therefore now back in app.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.516,
          "end": 173.88,
          "en": "we can use this concept component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.88,
          "end": 178.083,
          "en": "And for it to be usable here, we also must import it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 181.71,
          "en": "So here we should import concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.71,
          "end": 186.71,
          "en": "from ./Components/Concept/Concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.36,
          "end": 192.81,
          "en": "And with that import here added, we can go down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.81,
          "end": 194.4,
          "en": "use the concept component like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.4,
          "end": 196.68,
          "en": "as a self-closing component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.68,
          "end": 198.51,
          "en": "because I'm not passing anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.51,
          "end": 201.48,
          "en": "between its opening and closing tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.48,
          "end": 206.48,
          "en": "And then here, we can set the image prop, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 208.11,
          "end": 212.22,
          "en": "because in concept, I'm extracting an image prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.22,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "So I'm looking for this key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 217.23,
          "en": "hence we should provide it here, on this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.23,
          "end": 221.237,
          "en": "And set these to concepts(0).image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.91,
          "end": 228.78,
          "en": "So we're still accessing that concepts data from this array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.78,
          "end": 232.62,
          "en": "but we're now passing it to our own custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.62,
          "end": 233.453,
          "en": "And of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.453,
          "end": 235.29,
          "en": "we're now going to do the same for the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.29,
          "end": 239.52,
          "en": "Here, we should access concepts(0).title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.52,
          "end": 242.88,
          "en": "And last but not least, we also wanna do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 242.88,
          "end": 244.5,
          "en": "for the description of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.5,
          "end": 247.65,
          "en": "and pass concepts(0).description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 250.203,
          "en": "as a value for the description prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.94,
          "end": 255.12,
          "en": "With that, if I formatted this, the code looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 255.12,
          "end": 258.71,
          "en": "And now we can easily replace those list items here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 258.71,
          "end": 261.979,
          "en": "with our own custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.979,
          "end": 265.44,
          "en": "and pass the correct data to the props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.44,
          "end": 269.16,
          "en": "So here for concepts(1), on that second item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.16,
          "end": 272.13,
          "en": "and on the third item for concepts(2),",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 272.13,
          "end": 274.93399999999997,
          "en": "so for the third concepts item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 274.93399999999997,
          "end": 278.46,
          "en": "And with that, we now got this reusable component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 278.46,
          "end": 280.35,
          "en": "and we are reusing it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.35,
          "end": 284.04,
          "en": "and we are configuring it, with help of props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.04,
          "end": 288.212,
          "en": "And the HTML structure, is now only defined once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 288.212,
          "end": 290.259,
          "en": "inside of this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 290.259,
          "end": 292.92,
          "en": "but it can now easily be reused,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 292.92,
          "end": 295.53,
          "en": "thanks to our custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 295.53,
          "end": 298.95,
          "en": "And I make sure that here I'm accessing concepts(2),",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 298.95,
          "end": 301.8,
          "en": "not concepts(3), which would be wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 301.8,
          "end": 303.768,
          "en": "And I saved this again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 303.768,
          "end": 306.69,
          "en": "I've now got the same website as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.69,
          "end": 309.36,
          "en": "with those key concepts items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 309.36,
          "end": 312.78,
          "en": "but now we're building it with help of custom components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 312.78,
          "end": 315.345,
          "en": "custom reusable components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.345,
          "end": 318.84,
          "en": "And therefore, all three tasks that I gave you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.84,
          "end": 321.933,
          "en": "at the beginning of the section, are now solved.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}